# Fabricator economy: the guide's third loop step ("upgrade Fabricators,
# then build more") and the only income that needs no pool -- the champion
# ends every Impossible match with all 9 pools taken and income capped
# ([[community-play-strategies]]). fabricatorT1 is $2,200, generates 4x
# slower than an extractor (~3/s), upgradable T2/T3, and stands on the ring
# (needs_pool false). Two in the goals; the generic income-upgrade channel
# walks their tiers with the extractors' own machinery.

name tech-fab
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,fabricatorT1,fabricatorT1
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
